Z||000004||Fformula88||02-04-2001||09:42 PM||||That sucks man.  Sorry to hear it.  You should be able to pick up an engine for about $500 with decent milage at a bone yard.  It may take a few calls to find one, but I am sure you could come up with one.  Good luck!<P>------------------<BR>John<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/formula2m6/FIEROSIG1.JPG">      <BR>1988 Fiero Formula<BR>1985 Fiero SE 2m6<BR>1987 Fiero Sport Coupe *In rebuilding*<BR>1997 Ford Probe SE<BR>AOL IM: Fformula88||||reg||1
